Band Description: A four-piece ensemble consisting of a disgraced aerialist on vocals, a pyrotechnician on modular synthesizers, a symphony bassist using a literal circus rigging cable as a string, and a percussionist who plays exclusively on tuned scrap metal salvaged from the original chandelier crash.

